/* heap.yon — the package file of `heap`, under prelude/.
 *
 * The two heaps every Space owns, the handlers of allocation. FnvHeap gives a
 * value its identity by content, LeechHeap by point. Each lives in a Region
 * and is the only code that reads and writes its words: that is what makes
 * the code here heap code, which allocates nothing. */
